### Create Client
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/client HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "My test client",
    "scopes": ["profile-read", "profile-edit"],
    "redirect_uri": "http://localhost:8080/authorize",
    "active": true,
}

### Get clients
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/clients HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get client
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/client/{{client_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Edit client
PUT {{base}}/v1/admin/client/{{client_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id": "{{client_id}}",
    "name": "My Test Client"
}

### Delete client
DELETE {{base}}/v1/admin/client/{{client_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
